course: dictionary
lesson: 42
title: Accession: one word, three meanings
level: primary-6
stars: 2
explain: Accession is a formal word, so you will meet it in history, news and museum writing. Its meaning depends on the context, so the words around it are your best clue.
explain: When a king or queen comes to the throne, that is their accession. In «after his accession to the throne», accession means becoming king. In news about countries, accession means joining a group, as in «accession to the European Union».
explain: A new book in a library or a new object in a museum also has an accession. Its accession number is the number given to it when it joins the collection. Ask yourself: is this about a ruler, a group, or an item? The clues will tell you.
fact: Accession means coming to an important position or joining something.
fact: «Accession» is a formal word, so you will mostly find it in history, news and museum writing.
fact: Ukraine applied to join the EU in February 2022 and became a candidate in June 2022. Accession talks opened in June 2024, so Ukraine is a candidate, not yet a member.
fact: An «accession number» is the number given to a new item in a library or museum.
fact: One word can have several meanings; the context tells you which one is right.
exercise: In «after his accession to the throne», what does accession mean? | Leaving the palace | Painting a portrait | Losing a battle | *Becoming king
exercise: Ukraine applied to join the EU, and «accession talks» opened in 2024. Is Ukraine a member yet? | Yes, since 2024 | It left the EU | Yes, since 2022 | *No, it is a candidate, not yet a member
exercise: In a museum, what is an accession number? | A ticket price | A page number in a guidebook | *The number given to a new item added to the collection | The number of visitors
test: Which sentence uses accession to mean joining an organisation? | He counted the accession numbers on the shelf | *The country made its accession to the union in the spring | She read an accession book about birds | The king's accession was celebrated with bells
test: In a library, a new book is given an accession number. What is the accession number? | *The number given to the new item when it joins the collection | The price of the book | The name of the author | The number of pages
exam: Accession has three meanings; which one means a new item added to a collection? | Joining a union of countries | *A new book added to a library | Leaving a museum | Becoming a king or queen
